        "Small Business Electrics",
        "Office, retail and hospitality electrical work including consumer unit upgrades, emergency lighting and PAT testing.",
        "Consumer Unit Upgrades",
        "Old fuse boxes replaced with modern RCBO consumer units for better protection against faults and fire risk.",
        "Fire & Smoke Alarms",
